description: "guarantees[5]: Universal Artifact Ontology,Explicit Ownership,Complete Lifecycle,Graph Native Relationships,Unlimited Extensibility"
spec:
  id: artifact_types
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Ontology
  compiler_stage: Knowledge Representation
  description: Defines every engineering artifact that can exist within the TOON Engineering Universe. Artifacts are persistent outputs produced throughout the software engineering lifecycle. Every Engineering Knowledge Record references zero or more Engineering Artifacts.
purpose: "\"Create a universal ontology for every artifact produced, modified, consumed or analyzed during software engineering.\""
ekr: "\"Every Engineering Knowledge Record may\"[5]: produce artifacts,consume artifacts,modify artifacts,validate artifacts,document artifacts"
success: Every engineering output is represented as an Engineering Artifact.
future:
  artifact_templates: true
  artifact_inheritance: true
  semantic_search: true
  automated_generation: true
  graph_embeddings: true
